  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v5.8.33 - on SpawnDev.ILGPU 5.4.53. WebGPU: a captured replay ends with its submit instead of a GPU wait (Chrome charges ~2.9 ms per waited submit): MobileNetV2 captured replay with readback 8.0 to 5.1 ms. Convolutions: a 32x32-tile implicit-GEMM kernel for small grids, bit-identical to the 64x64 kernel (MobileNetV2 WebGPU GPU time 1.58 to 1.24 ms, desktop 3x3 at 7x7 1.8x; on by default on the desktop, off in the browser where it costs a first run 72 ms). Model stores: a sidecar that cannot be read throws instead of reading as no record (a scanner holding it made a complete model re-download from byte 0); atomic sidecar writes. ModelResidency: a lazy model is measured at its own first run, not charged for models that load after it in the same prompt.",
